Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 04:04:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] updates: no word of an update channel to come
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

In a system without an update channel, the help of "Automatic Updates"
said that it had no update channel "yet", and the window of "Available
Versions" that it did not update itself "yet" ("todavía" in Spanish).
Nothing is announced: both now say only what is so. The rest of the two
texts is as it was, in English and in the three Spanish catalogues,
whose English lines follow en_gb.

Seen on the screen of a virtual machine in English, es_es and es_mx
(the Spanish help still takes three lines of its box). Tested with the
test of Updates: 20 checks of the texts; they fail on the texts
before this change and on each of 7 changes that undo a part of
this change or of the one before it.
